<title>USA: Ecomat signs Australia franchise deal.</title>
<headline>Ecomat signs Australia franchise deal.</headline>
<dateline>MAMARONECK, N.Y. 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecomat Inc said on Wednesday it signed a master franchise agreement for Australia that calls for the opening of 144 locations there over an eight-year period.</p>
<p>Ecomat said in a news release that Craig Braun and Lynette Barp are the new franchisee for Australia.</p>
<p>Ecomat is a cleaners and laundromat franchisor that offers garment care without toxic chemicals.</p>
<p>Ecomat shares were up 3/8 to 6-7/8 in afternoon trading.</p>
